# Project Context

Personal portfolio website for Ivan Pacheco — a Next.js 15 App Router site with SSG, no backend.

## Tech Stack

Next.js 15 (App Router, SSG) · React 18 · TypeScript 5.8 · Tailwind CSS 3 · Framer Motion · Radix UI (dialog only) · Lucide icons

## File Structure

```
app/
  layout.tsx              # Root: next/font (Space Grotesk + JetBrains Mono), Metadata API, JSON-LD
  page.tsx                # Home — composes all sections
  not-found.tsx           # 404 page
  globals.css             # Tailwind + CSS variables (HSL dark theme)
  sitemap.ts              # Auto-generated XML sitemap
  robots.ts               # Crawler rules
  opengraph-image.tsx     # Edge-rendered OG image (1200x630)
components/
  navbar.tsx              # Fixed nav, mobile hamburger, scroll-aware blur ("use client")
  hero-section.tsx        # Profile photo (next/image), bio, social links ("use client")
  experience-section.tsx  # 7-entry work timeline ("use client")
  skills-section.tsx      # 7-category skill grid ("use client")
  education-section.tsx   # 4 education cards + achievement + DiplomaGallery ("use client")
  diploma-gallery.tsx     # PDF carousel with Dialog viewer ("use client")
  projects-section.tsx    # 4 featured project cards ("use client")
  contact-section.tsx     # 5 contact links ("use client")
  ui/
    dialog.tsx            # Radix dialog primitive — only UI component
lib/
  utils.ts                # cn() — clsx + tailwind-merge
public/
  profile-photo.jpg       # Hero profile image
  diplomas/               # PDF certificates
  favicon.ico
```

## Key Conventions

- **Data**: All content hardcoded as const arrays in each component. No API calls.
- **Routing**: Single page (`/`) with anchor links (`#experience`, `#skills`, etc.).
- **SEO**: Full Metadata API, JSON-LD Person schema, sitemap.ts, robots.ts, dynamic OG image.
- **Fonts**: next/font/google — Space Grotesk (body) + JetBrains Mono (code). Zero FOUT.
- **Styling**: Dark-only theme. HSL CSS variables. Primary: `hsl(160 84% 39%)` (teal/green). Card pattern: `bg-card border-border hover:border-primary/30`.
- **Animation**: Framer Motion `whileInView` with `viewport={{ once: true }}`. Staggered children `delay: i * 0.08`.
- **Components**: All sections are `"use client"` (Framer Motion). Layout/page are Server Components.
- **Images**: next/image with priority on hero photo, AVIF/WebP formats.

## Scripts

- `npm run dev` — Next.js dev server (port 3000)
- `npm run build` — Production SSG build
- `npm run start` — Serve production build
- `npm run lint` — Next.js ESLint
